---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'April 28, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Griffith Creative"
  description="How Griffith Creative collects, uses, and protects information submitted through griffithcreative.co."
>
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-offwhite-muted text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
        Privacy
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight mb-4">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm mb-12">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-offwhite-muted leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-offwhite text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            Griffith Creative ("we," "us") is a design studio based in Los Angeles, California. This policy describes how we handle information collected through griffithcreative.co.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-offwhite text-2xl font-bold mb-3">What we collect</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            We collect only the information you choose to provide through our contact form. That includes:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Your name and email address</li>
            <li>Your business name (optional)</li>
            <li>The service you're interested in (optional)</li>
            <li>Your current website (optional)</li>
            <li>The message you send us</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We do not use third-party advertising trackers or sell user data. Standard server logs may temporarily record IP addresses for security and abuse prevention.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-offwhite text-2xl font-bold mb-3">How we use it</h2>
          <p>
            We use the information you submit solely to respond to your inquiry, schedule a discovery call, and provide a project proposal. We don't share, rent, or sell it to anyone.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-offwhite text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Service providers</h2>
          <p>
            We use the following providers to operate this site and respond to inquiries:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mt-3">
            <li><strong class="text-offwhite">Vercel</strong>: hosting and edge delivery.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-offwhite">Resend</strong>: transactional email delivery for contact form submissions.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            These providers process limited data on our behalf under their own privacy and security commitments.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-offwhite text-2xl font-bold mb-3">How long we keep it</h2>
          <p>
            Inquiry messages are retained in our email system for as long as they're useful to the relationship. You can ask us to delete your information at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@griffithcreative.co" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors">hello@griffithcreative.co</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-offwhite text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, or delete the personal information we hold about you. To exercise any of these rights, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@griffithcreative.co" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors">hello@griffithcreative.co</a> and we'll respond promptly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-offwhite text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            This site does not set tracking cookies. If we add analytics in the future that uses cookies, we will update this page first.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-offwhite text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Changes</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-offwhite text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@griffithcreative.co" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors">hello@griffithcreative.co</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
